    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμείγνυμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμᾰσ-ύω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμᾰσ-μίσγω</span></b> , also in <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>HP</u>
			9.7.2
		</span></i> and later Prose, <i><span class="en">
			Phld.
			<u>Ir.</u>
			p.54
		</span></i> W.(
			Pass.
		) :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>intermingle, mix with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					878
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψόγον καὶ νουθεσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.59b
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὴν παραμεμεῖχθαι τῇ εὐδαιμονίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1177a23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. only,
				<i>mix in, add by mixing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ παραμίσγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.203
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				4.61
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλι, σμύρνην</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.162
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεατίου μικρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					84
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τι αὐτοῖς τούτων ἐν ταῖς ψυχαῖς
					παραμέμεικται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					415b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
